-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">根據《<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CNN</span>》報導，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">NASA</span>這項新研究<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">30</span>日發表在國際權威期刊《科學》雜誌，科學家發現，南極洲與格陵蘭州每年分別融化<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1180</span>億噸與<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2000</span>億噸的冰水進入海中，導致海平面從<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2003</span>年至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年間上升了約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1.3</span>公分，而當前融冰的速度更是來到新高點。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">研究將持續飆高的融冰速度歸因於夏季均溫升高，偏高的溫度導致冰川與冰蓋的固態水持續融化，進而構成促使更多冰融化的正回饋條件。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">研究主要作者，美國華盛頓大學冰川學家史密斯（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Ben Smith</span>）表示，經過長達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">16</span>年的觀察與研究，科學家現已可確定持續不斷加劇的冰融狀況，與長期氣候變化有關。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://news.ltn.com.tw/news/world/breakingnews/3152768</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border